{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is a Vampire RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a twisted gothic version of our world.<br><br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br><br>Investigate a series of disappearances of your fellow Vampires, including your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many mysteries to fear in the dark gothic world of Nightborn. Creatures beyond comprehension to discover, catalog, and, if you are skilled enough, survive.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you say carefully. You may insult or befriend NPCs based on what you say. Gather information and keep your secrets close to your chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive.\u00a0<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2509440?t=1770501014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/f27a1105653ee6bd104d05c2f42ac4567119df94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770501014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/a2d83358e2af9c4ed2450a4386ce93d601e68e4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770501014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/a2d83358e2af9c4ed2450a4386ce93d601e68e4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770501014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Mature themes including violence, blood, murder, injury, horror elements, sexual conduct, crime, alcohol and drug use. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is a Vampire RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a twisted gothic version of our world.<br><br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br><br>Investigate a series of disappearances of your fellow Vampires, including your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many mysteries to fear in the dark gothic world of Nightborn. Creatures beyond comprehension to discover, catalog, and, if you are skilled enough, survive.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you say carefully. You may insult or befriend NPCs based on what you say. Gather information and keep your secrets close to your chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1770501014\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1770501014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive.\u00a0<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Occupational Hazard"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/8e32dc10e03264b2bd0d31402003579b69ac2e22/header.jpg?t=1770501014","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Occupational Hazard LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2509440/1470999885/74b473c62d1d9e54b66f8b3da61b8b619f3d05de/1750926190/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749760280","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2509440/1470999885/74b473c62d1d9e54b66f8b3da61b8b619f3d05de/1750926190/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749760280","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2509440/1470999885/74b473c62d1d9e54b66f8b3da61b8b619f3d05de/1750926190/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749760280","id":257142866,"name":"Nightborn: Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142866/8687eabc7dda48dc4a3f4a641ee89bbd392b3a36/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749760280"}],"name":"Nightborn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or vers